1. Alert o‘zi nima?
Alert → foydalanuvchiga muhim xabar ko‘rsatadigan blok.
Masalan:
Success → Ish muvaffaqiyatli bajarildi
Info    → Ma'lumot
Warning → Ogohlantirish
Danger  → Xatolik/xavf
2. Oddiy Alerts
<div class="alert alert-success">
    <strong>Success!</strong> Ish muvaffaqiyatli bajarildi.
</div>

<div class="alert alert-info">
    <strong>Info!</strong> Bu ma'lumot.
</div>

<div class="alert alert-warning">
    <strong>Warning!</strong> Ehtiyot bo'ling.
</div>

<div class="alert alert-danger">
    <strong>Danger!</strong> Xatolik yuz berdi.
</div>
3. Alert Links

Alert ichida link bo‘lsa, .alert-link ishlatiladi.
<div class="alert alert-success">
    <strong>Success!</strong>
    <a href="#" class="alert-link">Bu xabarni o'qing</a>.
</div>
4. Closing Alerts — yopiladigan Alert

× ni bossang alert yo‘qoladi.
<div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible">

    <a href="#" class="close" data-dismiss="alert">
        &times;
    </a>

    <strong>Success!</strong>
    Ish muvaffaqiyatli bajarildi.

</div>
.alert-dismissible → alertni yopish imkonini beradi

.close             → × tugmasini yopish tugmasi qiladi

data-dismiss="alert" → bosilganda alertni yopadi

&times;             → × belgisi
5. Animated Alerts

Alert yopilganda sekin fade bo‘lib yo‘qoladi.
<div class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible fade in">

    <a href="#" class="close" data-dismiss="alert">
        &times;
    </a>

    <strong>Danger!</strong>
    Xatolik yuz berdi.

</div>
.alert              → Alert yaratadi

.alert-success      → muvaffaqiyat
.alert-info         → ma'lumot
.alert-warning      → ogohlantirish
.alert-danger       → xavf/xatolik

.alert-link         → alert ichidagi link

.alert-dismissible  → yopiladigan alert
.close              → yopish tugmasi
data-dismiss="alert" → alertni yopadi
&times;             → × belgisi

.fade               → fade effekt
.in                 → effektni yoqadi
